*> Edge cases of the tools programs (coverage-only additions): expression errors and clamps, all_of, Resistance beyond V, negative protection, over-blocked damage, armor above 20, knockback cap, small falls, over-merged repair, higher left level, luck beyond the fish weight.
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-TOOL-EXTRA-EDGES.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 01 WS-I1 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I2 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I3 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I4 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I5 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I6 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I7 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I8 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I9 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I10 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I11 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I12 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I13 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I14 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I15 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I16 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-T1 PIC X(200).
 01 WS-T2 PIC X(200).
 01 WS-T3 PIC X(200).
 01 WS-O1 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-O2 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-O3 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-O4 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-O5 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-O6 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-O7 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-O8 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-O9 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-O10 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-O11 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-O12 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-X1 PIC X(48).
 01 WS-X2 PIC X(48).
 01 WS-X3 PIC X(48).
 01 WS-OBS PIC X(240).
 01 WS-E1 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E2 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E3 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E4 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E5 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E6 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E7 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E8 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E9 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E10 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E11 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E12 PIC -(9)9.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     MOVE "acceptance US14 28.4 a non-number argument is a syntax error" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-T1
     MOVE "linear abc 1" TO WS-T1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-I1
     CALL "TOOL-LBV-EVAL" USING WS-T1 WS-I1 WS-O1 WS-O2
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     MOVE WS-O2 TO WS-E2
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) "/" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E2) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE "0/2" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-DONE

     MOVE "acceptance US14 28.4 clamped raises a value under the minimum" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-T1
     MOVE "clamped 2 4 linear 0 1" TO WS-T1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-I1
     CALL "TOOL-LBV-EVAL" USING WS-T1 WS-I1 WS-O1 WS-O2
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     MOVE WS-O2 TO WS-E2
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) "/" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E2) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE "20000/0" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-DONE

     MOVE "acceptance US14 28.5 all_of opens a list" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-T1
     MOVE "all_of add 1.0" TO WS-T1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 10000 TO WS-I2
     CALL "TOOL-VALUE-FOLD" USING WS-T1 WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-O1 WS-O2
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     MOVE WS-O2 TO WS-E2
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) "/" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E2) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE "20000/0" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-DONE

     MOVE "acceptance US14 4.4 Resistance beyond V never goes negative; negative protection counts as 0" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE 10000 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 5 TO WS-I2
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I3
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I4
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I5
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I6
     CALL "TOOL-MAGIC-ABSORB" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-I5 WS-I6 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE 10000 TO WS-I1
     MOVE -1 TO WS-I2
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I3
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I4
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I5
     MOVE -5 TO WS-I6
     CALL "TOOL-MAGIC-ABSORB" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-I5 WS-I6 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE "0 10000" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-DONE

     MOVE "acceptance US14 4.4 blocking more than the damage leaves 0 and the armor still wears 1" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE 8000 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 2 TO WS-I2
     MOVE 1 TO WS-I3
     MOVE 9000 TO WS-I4
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I5
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I6
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I7
     MOVE -1 TO WS-I8
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I9
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I10
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I11
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I12
     CALL "TOOL-HURT-PIPELINE" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-I5 WS-I6 WS-I7 WS-I8 WS-I9 WS-I10 WS-I11 WS-I12 WS-O1 WS-O2 WS-O3
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     MOVE WS-O2 TO WS-E2
     MOVE WS-O3 TO WS-E3
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) "/" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E2) "/" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E3) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE "0/0/1" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-DONE

     MOVE "acceptance US14 4.5 armor above 20 is capped at 20 effective points" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE 10000 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 30 TO WS-I2
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I3
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I4
     CALL "TOOL-ARMOR-ABSORB" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE "2000" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-DONE

     MOVE "acceptance US14 4.6 the vertical knockback on the ground is capped at 0.4" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE 400 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I2
     MOVE 1000 TO WS-I3
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I4
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I5
     MOVE 1000 TO WS-I6
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I7
     MOVE 1 TO WS-I8
     CALL "TOOL-KNOCKBACK" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-I5 WS-I6 WS-I7 WS-I8 WS-O1 WS-O2 WS-O3 WS-O4
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     MOVE WS-O2 TO WS-E2
     MOVE WS-O3 TO WS-E3
     MOVE WS-O4 TO WS-E4
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) "/" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E2) "/" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E3) "/" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E4) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE "-400/400/0/1" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-DONE

     MOVE "acceptance US14 4.11 a fall under the safe distance does no damage" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE 1000 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 1000 TO WS-I2
     CALL "TOOL-FALL-DAMAGE" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE "0" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-DONE

     MOVE "acceptance US14 5.6 a merge past the full durability gives damage 0" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE 2 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 100 TO WS-I2
     MOVE 60 TO WS-I3
     MOVE 60 TO WS-I4
     CALL "TOOL-MERGE-DAMAGE" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE "0" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-DONE

     MOVE "acceptance US14 5.4 a higher level on the left is kept" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE 3 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-I2
     MOVE 5 TO WS-I3
     MOVE 2 TO WS-I4
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I5
     CALL "TOOL-ANVIL-ENCHANT" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-I5 WS-O1 WS-O2
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     MOVE WS-O2 TO WS-E2
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) "/" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E2) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE "3/6" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-DONE

     MOVE "acceptance US14 3.11 a large luck takes fish and junk to 0" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE 90 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-I2
     CALL "TOOL-FISH-WEIGHTS" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-O1 WS-O2 WS-O3
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     MOVE WS-O2 TO WS-E2
     MOVE WS-O3 TO WS-E3
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) "/" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E2) "/" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E3) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE "0/0/185" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-DONE

     STOP RUN.

 ADD-OBS.
     IF TL-OBSERVED = SPACES
         MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-OBS) TO TL-OBSERVED
     ELSE
         STRING FUNCTION TRIM(TL-OBSERVED) " " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-OBS) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     END-IF.

 CHECK-DONE.
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT.
 END PROGRAM TEST-TOOL-EXTRA-EDGES.
